id=tailscale_root
name=Tailscale Root
version=v0.7.0
versionCode=18
author=Lxns
description=Standalone root tailscaled, one version only (offline bundle / online / local file all install to the same place, pin a version to keep it) + WebUI (status / peers / latency chart / updater / logs) + one-tap Action toggle. Self-hosted Headscale supported, auto hostname from device name, optional HTTP-proxy egress (auto-detects Box for Root), src_valid_mark guard keeps tproxy modules working alongside WireGuard. Config: /data/adb/tailscale/env
